\f0\fs24 \cf0 # LUMIN-GNN: Comprehensive Experimental Framework\
\
This repository contains the implementation of **LUMIN-GNN** and baseline Graph Neural Network models evaluated on multiple benchmark datasets.\
\
The project supports the following:\
\
- Datasets:\
  - Cora\
  - CiteSeer\
  - OGBN-Arxiv\
  - Chameleon\
\
- Models:\
  - GCN\
  - GAT\
  - GraphSAGE\
  - H2GCN\
  - MixHop\
  - LUMIN-GNN\
\
A total of **24 model-dataset combinations** are implemented.\
\
