# Expected Outputs\
\
Each experiment prints:\
\
```text\
Epoch 000 Train 0.xxxx Val 0.xxxx Test 0.xxxx\
Epoch 020 Train 0.xxxx Val 0.xxxx Test 0.xxxx\
...\
Early stopping at epoch xxx\
\
Best Validation Accuracy: xx.xx%\
Best Test Accuracy: xx.xx%\
```\
\
