\
# Generated Files\
\
The framework automatically saves:\
\
- Training Loss Curves\
- Validation Loss Curves\
- Test Loss Curves\
- Accuracy Curves\
- Final Results Tables\
- Mean \'b1 Standard Deviation across runs\
\
inside:\
\
```text\
results/\
\uc0\u9500 \u9472 \u9472  cora/\
\uc0\u9500 \u9472 \u9472  citeseer/\
\uc0\u9500 \u9472 \u9472  ogbn_arxiv/\
\uc0\u9492 \u9472 \u9472  chameleon/\
```\
