# Reproducibility\
\
To reproduce the paper results:\
\
```python\
seeds = [42, 123, 456, 789, 2024]\
```\
\
Run each experiment using all seeds and report:\
\
```text\
Mean Accuracy \'b1 Standard Deviation\
```\
\
for all 24 combinations.}